Description: Edit every part of a KDE Plasma theme in one place
 Plasma Theme Studio keeps a whole KDE Plasma desktop theme in one file,
 shows it in a visual preview, and applies it to the running desktop: colors,
 window frame, Plasma style, panels, application style, GTK, fonts, icons,
 pointers and more, each part on its own page.
 .
 Every apply takes a snapshot first, so it can be undone exactly, from the
 app or from a text console. The app only writes inside your home folder and
 shows the files it is about to write.
